    36	(*   unavailable_since, failed_polls), the invocation sends a fence write *)
    37	(*   guarded on (state, attempt id, version read) that bumps the version, *)
    38	(*   and continues ONLY after it commits; then its own version is the     *)
    39	(*   bumped one. If the fence fails its guard (or is dropped) the         *)
    40	(*   invocation ends. Every later write of the invocation is guarded on    *)
